  "body": "Node.js has implemented a [`console.dir(obj[, options])`](https://nodejs.org/dist/latest-v7.x/docs/api/console.html#console_console_dir_obj_options) since Node v0.1.101.\r\n\r\nFrom what I can tell, it appears to be a more direct sort of proxy to [`util.format()`](https://nodejs.org/dist/latest-v7.x/docs/api/util.html#util_util_inspect_object_options) allowing the passing of options rather than additional objects.",
